      "id": "A0110_Future of Life Institute2024",
      "name": "Emergency Rollback Plan",
      "description": "Critically dangerous capabilities or very severe yet unexpected misuse patterns might only surface after a system has been deployed. Has your firm developed an emergency response plan to react to scenarios where such problems cannot be resolved quickly via updates? Please select all interventions that your organization has implemented.\n\nMade legal and technical preparations to roll back a system rapidly\nFormally specified the risk threshold that would trigger a rapid rollback\nCommitted to regular safety drills to test emergency response",
